# Do not take control of the UI

Do not drive the running app unless the user asks you to look at it, click through it, or check it.

That includes the browser: locking a tab, navigating, clicking, typing, scrolling, or taking screenshots of the app.

Editing code, running tests, and reading the dev-server log are fine. The user checks the screen.
